 "integration": {
  "summary": "Set the device instance, MAC address and baud from the STE-8001 sensor (COMM menu, Password 2) before putting the controller on the MS/TP trunk. Monitor AV 1 space temperature, AV 3/AV 4 active setpoints, AV 24 actual airflow and AV 50 damper position; the occupied setpoints are AV 5/AV 6. BV 1-3 and BV 7 are reset requests for the air handler.",
