   }
  ],
  "enable": null,
  "heartbeat": null,
  "remote_sensors": null,
  "setup": [
   "Device instance (7 digits), MAC address and baud are entered at the STE-8001 sensor: CNFG > COMM, Password 2 needed if one is set.",
   "BACnet MS/TP at up to 76.8 kbaud; no more than 128 devices per MS/TP network, 32 recommended.",
   "Set the EOL switches On only at the two physical ends of the trunk; the network bulbs light if the trunk is phased or grounded wrong.",
   "Restore Application resets the controller settings but keeps the BACnet communication settings."
  ],
  "gotchas": [
   "KMC warns that changing the configuration of objects can cause unpredictable operation; treat the setup AVs (K factor, flow limits, fan speeds) as commissioning values.",
   "The guide prints no state texts for the multistate values; read the State_Text property from the controller."
  ]
